**WARNING**: On the Bullet M2 xw, OpenWrt 21.02.1 never turns the Ethernet port on. TFTP can be used to revert to OpenWrt 19.07. See [[https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/issues/9178]] and [[https://owenh.net/bulletm2hp]].
The fix (commit [[https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/commit/e405b96fe774fbad9c4c465f41ad853a970439bf|e405b96fe774]]) is now in the main, 22.03, and 23.05 branches and should be included in OpenWrt 22.03.7 and 23.05.3 when those are released.

